            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party Hard 2 is coming!</h2><br><br><br>Manage your own nightclub in Party Hard Tycoon, the most accurate nightclub sim of the year! Expanding upon the AI &amp; hilarious setups of Party Hard, the game takes a tycoon-style look at what it's like to be a professional partymaker.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513330/extras/eb1bfee7ce4e5fbe0892529d6336426e.poster.avif?t=1739398961\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513330/extras/eb1bfee7ce4e5fbe0892529d6336426e.webm?t=1739398961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513330/extras/eb1bfee7ce4e5fbe0892529d6336426e.mp4?t=1739398961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Organize the perfect party<br></li><li>Pick a theme to make your event special<br></li><li>Place the speakers accurately to drive your guests crazy<br></li><li>Don't forget about security, entertainment, and booze</li></ul>",
